  "reasoning": "The facts show that the defendant received large sums of money in exchange for using his influence to obtain project contracts and mining rights (e.g., 300万 from partners, 200万 from mining investors, 50万 from a developer). These constitute receipt of bribes, i.e., the crime of 受贿. He also paid 100万 to a local official and 35万 on behalf of a company to another official to obtain favorable treatment, which are acts of giving bribes, i.e., the crimes of 行贿 (individual bribery) and 单位行贿 (company‑bribery). No other distinct offenses are indicated. Therefore the applicable crimes are 受贿, 行贿, and 单位行贿.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿;行贿;单位行贿<eoa>"
}
